# NATHAN AI — MASTER ORIGINAL WORDS / SOURCE-TO-DESTINATION INDEX

**Source-first policy:** CREATE ONCE. TRANSFORM INTO EVERYTHING. PRESERVE THE ORIGINAL.

This is an additive index of project destinations, not a claim that every message in all historical conversations has been recovered. Exact retrieved Snow Family excerpts are preserved in `snow-family/original-excerpts.md` and `snow-family/original-excerpts-continued.md`.

| Project/source domain | Existing destination | Material to recover | Classification boundary |
|---|---|---|---|
| Snow Family / 19-level Earth | `app-factory/nathan-ai/original-words/snow-family/` | Verbatim user wording, exact level order, Babel, equator, Inferno, two corkscrews, Tools of Tabor | Author world-model vs measured geology |
| Trinity of Snow | Existing PR #78 | Book / mythological saga / 19-level awakening | Symbolic narrative vs statements of medical effect |
| ONE Matrix | `app-factory/one/nathan-matrix/` | Matrix diagrams and original labels | Secondary classification, do not replace sources |
| DATA ATAD | `app-factory/one/restored/data-atad/` | Original algorithms, language sound, personal phonics | Source sound vs historical etymology |
| KJV Blueprint Atlas | `app-factory/one/restored/kjv-blueprint-atlas/` | Every biblical item and stated measurement | Literal object vs figurative or visionary transformation |
| KJV Gates/Weapons | `app-factory/one/restored/gates-weapons-explorer/` | Attributes, materials, dimensions, original item identities | Mechanisms vs metaphors, no fabricated designs |
| Vatican/World texts | `app-factory/one/restored/vatican-catalog/` | Known holdings, candidate research titles | Verified presence vs conjectured holdings |
| Five Matrix 3-D Print Shop | `app-factory/one/five-matrix-print-shop/` | Original five-node source, voxel UI, five-to-ONE | Live software vs simulated physical hardware |
| Protect Innocence | `app-factory/one/restored/protect-innocence/` | Authored text and resource module | Original expression vs factual allegation |
| TABOR 1-2-3 FACTORY | `app-factory/` | Unified creation and distribution workflows | Existing original owner sources remain untouched |
| Nathan AI website | `app-factory/nathan-ai/websites/` | Launch links to source archives | No private material silently published |
| Scripture + language research | DATA ATAD and KJV atlas | Hebrew, Greek, Latin, Arabic, scripts, symbols, words | Primary source vs user interpretation |

## Mandatory record fields
- `source_id`, `original_exact`, `source_kind` (direct utterance / prior utterance / uploaded source / assistant text / inference)
- `source_location`, `timestamp_if_known`, `source_access` (available / not yet recovered)
- `original_identity` and `secondary_classifications`
- `literal`, `figurative`, `mythological`, `historical_evidence_status`
- `language`, `script`, `sound`, `direction`, `transformations` (derived, no overwrite)
- `measurement_as_written`, `measurement_status` and `citations`

## Historical recovery boundary
Do **not** synthesize missing author dialogue from an assistant summary. If the exact user-authored words are not available, create a missing-source entry instead. Do not delete original user words, create fictional missing books, overwrite files from another feature branch or claim private resources were copied.

## Needed follow-through
- Retrieve original texts from available conversation files and other expressly authorized stores.
- Merge this branch after review with existing Snow PR #78 and earlier original-source restoration PR #77 without overwriting either.
- Continue adding source pages under the correct project directories, with quote-level verification and testing.
